With this application developed by EID Atlantique :
- Take photos of mosquitoes ;
- Indicate the presence of mosquitoes, including the "tiger mosquito" ;
- Learn about the "good practice" for prevention ;
- Learn more about mosquitoes and their identification ;
This application does not need a web connection.
EID Atlantique - ì Working to prevent health risks î :
EID Atlantique is a french public agency specializing in entomological surveillance and mosquito control. Learn about our structure, our missions, our actions and our field of intervention.
